SUMMARY:Rippling Event – Stop managing HR in silos
DESCRIPTION:Thank you for registering for our upcoming lunch - Stop managing HR in silos.\n\nOne source of truth today. Ready for the world tomorrow.\n\nThis lunch is about bringing HR and Finance leaders together to explore how consolidating disconnected systems, manual processes and one-off workarounds can create a stronger foundation for growth.\n\nWe’re looking forward to seeing you at Gilt Brasserie – 2 Chancery Street, Chambers, Auckland 1010, New Zealand.\n
LOCATION:Gilt Brasserie – 2 Chancery Street, Chambers, Auckland 1010, New Zealand
